{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Walking Trade</strong> is a quirky, action-packed zombie apocalypse store management game where chaos and commerce collide!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/f21922d02f4fb021cec12e6aa2c2527f.avif?t=1761138576\" width=616 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your shop, balancing space, aesthetics, and functionality. Organize shelves, set prices, and ensure customers leave happy - or at least alive.<i>  </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/ab8699213a71b72c33ad31807c7fc539.poster.avif?t=1761138576\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/ab8699213a71b72c33ad31807c7fc539.webm?t=1761138576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/ab8699213a71b72c33ad31807c7fc539.mp4?t=1761138576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/dcadb8da1a15837382751338d21801cc.avif?t=1761138576\" width=616 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers aren\u2019t your only problem - zombies invade! Wield melee weapons, firearms, or whatever you can find to defend your shop during raids and hordes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398110/extras/78b29bbfc98800300016d60bfc98a96c.poster.avif?t=1761138576\" width=616 height=346 ><source 